1. Add a new column:

ALTER TABLE students
ADD email VARCHAR(100);



2. Modify a column's data type:

ALTER TABLE students
MODIFY name VARCHAR(100);



3. Rename a column:

ALTER TABLE students
RENAME COLUMN name TO student_name;



4. Delete a column

ALTER TABLE students
DROP COLUMN email;



5. Rename a table

ALTER TABLE students
RENAME TO student_info;



6. Add a constraint

ALTER TABLE students
ADD CONSTRAINT pk_student PRIMARY KEY (student_id);

